legend: "Legend\nEdges: extends #CC79A7, implements #E69F00, permits #7C3AED, reads #0072B2, selects #EA580C, uses #6B7280, writes #D55E00\nConfidence overlay: resolved = relation style; syntactic = dashed gray #6B7280; ambiguous = dashed amber #B45309; cycle = red #B91C1C\nData: schema = dashed; runtime access = solid" {
  shape: text
  near: bottom-right
}
